---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact ShipMargin" description="Contact ShipMargin about calculation corrections, feedback and partnerships." canonicalPath="/contact/">
  <header class="tool-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Feedback improves the tool</span><h1>Found a rule we should check?</h1><p>We welcome calculation corrections, workflow feedback and partnership enquiries.</p></header>
  <article class="content-section"><h2>Before production launch</h2><p>The public support address will be added with the production domain so users can report incorrect rules and include the carrier, service, country and source documentation.</p><div class="notice"><strong>Please protect customer privacy.</strong> Never send names, addresses, tracking numbers, invoices or unredacted order exports when reporting a calculator issue.</div></article>
</BaseLayout>
